id: zw_debug
label: Z-Wave Debug
category: Z-Wave
description: >
  This component, which offers zw_debug, is a crucial tool for debugging and development.  If this component is installed, the firmware will be compiled with increased flash memory usage,  providing invaluable insights into application behavior and aiding in efficient troubleshooting and optimization.
package: zwave
quality: production
metadata:
  sbom:
    reference: zw_sbom_license
provides:
- name: zw_build_mode
- name: zw_debug
conflicts:
- name: zw_release
toolchain_settings:
- option: optimize
  value: debug
- option: debug_level
  value: default
root_path: zwave
